      "end_time": 6.151,
      "transcript": "ਗਉੜੀ ਕਬੀਰ ਜੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00002",
      "start_time": 12.117,
      "end_time": 18.025,
      "transcript": "ਚੋਆ ਚੰਦਨ, ਮਰਦਨ ਅੰਗਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00003",
      "start_time": 18.355,
      "end_time": 24.5,
      "transcript": "ਸੋ ਤਨੁ ਜਲੈ, ਕਾਠ ਕੈ ਸੰਗਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00004",
      "start_time": 24.5,
      "end_time": 30.68,
      "transcript": "ਇਸੁ ਤਨ ਧਨ ਕੀ, ਕਵਨ ਬਡਾਈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00005",
      "start_time": 30.68,
      "end_time": 39.985,
      "transcript": "ਧਰਨਿ ਪਰੈ, ਉਰਵਾਰਿ ਨ ਜਾਈ ਰਹਾਉ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00006",
      "start_time": 46.075,
      "end_time": 52.36,
      "transcript": "ਰਾਤਿ ਜਿ ਸੋਵਹਿ, ਦਿਨ ਕਰਹਿ ਕਾਮ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00007",
      "start_time": 52.36,
      "end_time": 58.225,
      "transcript": "ਇਕੁ ਖਿਨੁ, ਲੇਹਿ ਨ ਹਰਿ ਕੋ ਨਾਮ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00008",
      "start_time": 58.6,
      "end_time": 64.62,
      "transcript": "ਹਾਥਿ ਤ ਡੋਰ, ਮੁਖਿ ਖਾਇਓ ਤੰਬੋਰ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00009",
      "start_time": 64.62,
      "end_time": 70.625,
      "transcript": "ਮਰਤੀ ਬਾਰ, ਕਸਿ ਬਾਧਿਓ ਚੋਰ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00010",
      "start_time": 70.935,
      "end_time": 77.155,
      "transcript": "ਗੁਰਮਤਿ ਰਸਿ ਰਸਿ, ਹਰਿ ਗੁਨ ਗਾਵੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00011",
      "start_time": 77.155,
      "end_time": 83.475,
      "transcript": "ਰਾਮੈ ਰਾਮ ਰਮਤ, ਸੁਖੁ ਪਾਵੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00012",
      "start_time": 83.475,
      "end_time": 89.665,
      "transcript": "ਕਿਰਪਾ ਕਰਿ ਕੈ, ਨਾਮੁ ਦ੍ਰਿੜਾਈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00013",
      "start_time": 89.665,
      "end_time": 95.8,
      "transcript": "ਹਰਿ ਹਰਿ ਬਾਸੁ, ਸੁਗੰਧ ਬਸਾਈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00014",
      "start_time": 95.8,
      "end_time": 102.12,
      "transcript": "ਕਹਤ ਕਬੀਰ, ਚੇਤਿ ਰੇ ਅੰਧਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00015",
      "start_time": 102.12,
      "end_time": 108.247,
      "transcript": "ਸਤਿ ਰਾਮੁ, ਝੂਠਾ ਸਭੁ ਧੰਧਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00016",
      "start_time": 108.247,
      "end_time": 114.407,
      "transcript": "ਕਹਤ ਕਬੀਰ, ਚੇਤਿ ਰੇ ਅੰਧਾ"
    },
    {
